{"id":"n69471-1-14","stage":1,"title":"묻다 · 问","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69471-1-14-1","ko":"우리가 묻는 말에 솔직하게 대답해!","zh":"请诚实地回答我们提出的问题！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묻는","meaning":"问","explanation":"묻다：问；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69471","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말에","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"솔직하게","meaning":"坦诚，坦率","explanation":"솔직하다：坦诚，坦率；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"솔직하다","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85310","senseId":"1","lemma":"솔직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대답해!","meaning":"回答，解答","explanation":"대답하다：回答，解答；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"대답하다","audio":"/audio/c277fbed94900f03e940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85938","senseId":"2","lemma":"대답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"问","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"69471","definition":"要求回答或说明。","pronunciation":["묻ː따"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"c86a5bfccc9f530c","term":"솔직하다","zh":"坦诚，坦率","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3","entryId":"85310","definition":"不虚伪，不做作。","pronunciation":["솔찌카다"]},{"id":"c277fbed94900f03","term":"대답하다","zh":"回答，解答","audio":"/audio/c277fbed94900f03e940.mp3","entryId":"85938","definition":"对问或要求的事情做出相应的答复。","pronunciation":["대ː다파다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce3ecb27ec67b7b2d48b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69471-1-14-2","ko":"전 정말 아무 것도 몰라요.","zh":"我真的什么都不知道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰라요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c7fe654c494f0968937.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69471","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.083,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请诚实地回答我们提出的问题！","我真的什么都不知道。","我觉得果汁里可能需要再加点糖。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请诚实地回答我们提出的问题！","我真的什么都不知道。","我觉得果汁里可能需要再加点糖。"],"answer":1}]}
